{"id":"26eb5b3a994871b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Open Map","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Open Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Open Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-map-bijective-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-effectively-open-map — ZFC Recursion4 Effectively Open Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99f12f1125ed236a\" href=\"?note=99f12f1125ed236a\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85d80d720d53045b\" href=\"?note=85d80d720d53045b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-map-bijective-map\">58-df-zfc-map-bijective-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d_X,\\alpha_X)\">\\((X,d_X,\\alpha_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y)\">\\((Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y)\\)</span> (computable metric-space presentations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> (map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,p\\in V\">\\(\\rho,p\\in V\\)</span> (positive-rational enumeration and pair-decoding bijection)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\)</span> (computably-enumerable subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S\\)</span> (computable-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"99f12f1125ed236a\" href=\"?note=99f12f1125ed236a\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapBijectiveMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapBijectiveMap}_S\\)</span> (bijective-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"85d80d720d53045b\" href=\"?note=85d80d720d53045b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-map-bijective-map\">58-df-zfc-map-bijective-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyOpenMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyOpenMap}_S\\)</span> (effectively-open-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}effectively\\text{-}open\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyOpenMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f,\\rho,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\omega,\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\rho(n)=q)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMapBijectiveMap}_S(p,\\omega,\\omega\\times\\omega)\\land\n\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(W)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\nf\\bigl[\\{x\\in X:\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;(p(e)=\\langle m,n\\rangle\\land d_X(x,\\alpha_X(m))&lt;\\rho(n))\\}\\bigr]\n=\\bigcup_{\\substack{j\\in\\omega\\\\\\langle e,j\\rangle\\in W}}\n\\{y\\in Y:\\exists r,s\\in\\omega\\;(p(j)=\\langle r,s\\rangle\\land d_Y(y,\\alpha_Y(r))&lt;\\rho(s))\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}effectively\\text{-}open\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4EffectivelyOpenMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f,\\rho,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,\\omega,\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\rho(n)=q)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMapBijectiveMap}_S(p,\\omega,\\omega\\times\\omega)\\land\n\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(W)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\nf\\bigl[\\{x\\in X:\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;(p(e)=\\langle m,n\\rangle\\land d_X(x,\\alpha_X(m))&lt;\\rho(n))\\}\\bigr]\n=\\bigcup_{\\substack{j\\in\\omega\\\\\\langle e,j\\rangle\\in W}}\n\\{y\\in Y:\\exists r,s\\in\\omega\\;(p(j)=\\langle r,s\\rangle\\land d_Y(y,\\alpha_Y(r))&lt;\\rho(s))\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> turn each computable metric-space presentation into a numbered basis of rational balls without hiding coding data.</li>\n<li>One c.e. set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> uniformly enumerates, for every source basic ball, exactly the target basic balls whose union is its image. Thus openness and its effective uniformity are both part of the predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map","status":"resolved","id":"99f12f1125ed236a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locat